WEBVTT

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.960
You're going on a family vacation?

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.530
My father went ahead and made 
reservations at some lakeside

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.000
hotel without telling us.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.040
Lakeside...? It sounds really chic to me.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.440
Actually... actually, is it a fancy hotel?

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.990
I don't know.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:34.050
Come to think of it, didn't 
you say you were going

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.980
somewhere during the break, 
too, Yukishiro-san?

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.570
I'm going with my grandmother.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.720
We've had it planned for a while now.

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.280
So you're going somewhere, too, Honoka...

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.650
It's an old Japanese-style 
inn on the shores of a lake.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.200
The island that appears 
out of the lake has an

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.160
old legend, and even now, a 
strange phenomenon occurs.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.610
I feel like I'm going to encounter something.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.030
A strange phenomenon occurs...

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:08.160
And... and... she feels like she's 
going to encounter something...

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.740
You really are strange, Honoka.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.020
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.690
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.460
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:24.930
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.630
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.770
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.370
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.370
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.180
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:43.980
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:45.950
<i>we both</i>

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.290
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.850
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.860
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:56.430
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:59.600
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.170
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:08.340
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:09.640
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.110
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.150
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.420
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:22.490
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:26.220
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.790
It's been a while since I've felt so relaxed.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.840
The last time, a Pretty 
Cure imposter appeared.

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:42.740
I really don't know what 
we're up against this time.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.420
We have to be careful.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:48.040
Hey, Nagisa! Where are you going?

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.420
Over here... It's over here.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.840
Is this the place, Dad?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.390
I told you, didn't I?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.550
It's called Ryokan Lakeside.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:06.160
You mean Lakeside isn't a hotel?

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.130
Welcome!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:18.100
"A REALLY DANGEROUS FAMILY VACATION"

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.550
"A REALLY DANGEROUS FAMILY VACATION"

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.580
There are really some old 
things here, aren't there?

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.550
It's kind of scary, isn't it?

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.520
Don't worry...

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.770
I'm sorry... It's just me... See?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.290
Honoka?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.430
Are you staying here, too, Nagisa?

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:40.090
So it seems.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.890
I'm sure a coincidence, isn't it?

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.240
It certainly is a coincidence, 
isn't it, Honoka-san?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:47.710
It can't be.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.310
Is that right?

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.680
You just got here, too, Yukishiro-san.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.850
Honoka is always indebted to you.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:59.310
Not at all... Nagisa really 
is indebted to you.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:03.050
She's always telling us about Yukishiro-san.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:06.890
She's a member of the science club, and 
she's the top student in their class.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:08.860
No, I'm not...

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.480
The science club...?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.950
Actually, when I was in high school, 
I was in the science club, too.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.870
You were?

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:21.040
I had a dream of winning the Nobel 
Prize (noberu-sho) at one time.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:26.590
Even now, I do research on 
new materials, but if I'm

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.570
going to hey an award, it would be 
the drinking (nomeru-sho) prize.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.870
"Noberu-sho" and "nomeru-sho." Get it?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.240
Oh, no! He did it again!

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.790
This is embarrassing.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:40.650
Never mind that, Honoka-san.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.270
Isn't the lake beautiful?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.200
It really is!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.970
There's even a hot springs bath here...

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.670
It's really a peaceful and nice place.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.640
But there's something suspicious about this.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.570
No, there isn't.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.230
I'm sorry!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:02.610
Why don't you both join 
us for dinner tonight?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.790
The more the merrier.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.480
You don't want to impose 
on them, do you, dear?

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:10.620
Not all... We'd love to join you...

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.590
Wouldn't we, Honoka?

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:12.820
Yes.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.540
Aren't you lucky, Ryota?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:21.060
You can have dinner with Honoka-san, 
the girl of your dreams.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.670
What are you saying?

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.640
It's youth... It's just the bloom of youth.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:32.210
Your dad is cheerful, and fun, isn't he?

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.590
I don't know about that.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:35.610
He's always coming up with those silly puns.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.400
He just seems unreliable somehow.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.330
He didn't seem like that to me.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.390
Never mind that...

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:43.630
Doesn't today's coincidence scare you?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.730
Do you feel it, too?

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.910
This is definitely a situation thats 
conductive to those guys to appear, isn't it?

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.460
For example, in a place like this.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.600
It couldn't be...!

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.910
It couldn't have been her, could it?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:04.490
You're right.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.750
Let's go look at the souvenirs...

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.850
Better watch out.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.550
Mipple! Mipple!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.180
He woke up.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.370
Mepple! Mepple!

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.490
So did she.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.460
Running into each other at 
a faraway place like this

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.310
must be the power of our love mepo.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.410
It just has to be mepo!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.640
Okay... okay...

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.000
The power of love, huh?

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.180
You may be right. It's possible!

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:36.150
This is no time to be impressed.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.450
Both of you! Our families are with 
us today, so please be quiet.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:44.650
Then let us eat the delicious 
feast from the Japanese inn.

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.620
Feast?

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:48.090
That's right mipo!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.970
We want to eat mepo!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.970
We want to eat mipo!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:57.530
Okay, I got it, so just be quiet.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.570
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.830
These are our inn's specialties...

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:11.490
Seafood delicacies, a platter of vegetables, 
carpaccio-style salad, western-style

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.550
rolled sushi, slightly salted 
soup and sautéed meat.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:18.160
All-you-can-eat spiny lobster and crab.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.520
You're drooling mipo, Mepple.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:22.890
The lake legend?

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:24.030
That's right.

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:28.040
It's the legend of Hibiki Island that 
floats upon the nearby Otomegaike pond.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.730
Is this the legend I heard about?

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:33.230
That's right. A long time 
ago, a very beautiful

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:36.250
young maiden lived on Hibiki Island.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.040
The young maiden had two 
childhood friends who both

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:43.450
fell in love with her when 
they became adults...

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:47.550
this finally led to a dual between 
them in which they killed each other.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.460
It is said that the young 
maiden was so sad at

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:01.720
losing both of them, that 
she turned into a pine tree.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:05.620
The red armor and blue armor 
that the young warriors were

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:09.280
wearing were put on the side 
of the pine tree as shrines...

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.030
But it is said that you can 
still hear the sad sounds

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:15.180
of the young maiden's flute 
echo on the lake to this day.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:20.680
The feelings of sadness and conflict 
are still in the pine tree.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.820
It's a sad story, isn't it?

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.980
But it's mysterious and wonderful.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.750
If you pray while the sun 
is setting between the

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.490
two small shrines, your wish will be granted.

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:36.440
It's very foggy, so the boats hardly go out

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:40.430
there, but on a nice day, 
everyone goes out there.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:44.610
If we go now, we can make 
it for the sunset, Honoka.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.610
They're not listening...

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:45.940
Excuse me!

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:50.770
Today's our only chance to 
pray to the setting sun.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.540
That's true, but...

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:57.110
It's not fair for just 
the two of you to go...

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:59.050
Were you listening, Ryota?

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.170
I'm going, too.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:01.730
You'll just get in the way.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:06.120
We'll be back in time for dinner, 
so don't tell Mom and Dad.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.130
But...

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:11.680
In exchange, Honoka said she'll play 
with you as much as you want tomorrow.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:18.570
I know he's my brother, 
but he's so simple-minded.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.330
Be sure you keep your promise, Honoka-san.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.250
Poiko-san! What are you doing?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.340
Carry the trays!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.310
I'm coming!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.790
It's foggy, after all.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.250
I guess we can't go then.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:39.360
Are you going to Hibiki Island?

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.700
Yes... Are you taking the boat out?

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.230
The fog isn't heavy enough 
to keep me from going.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.200
How lucky!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.050
Thank you!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.890
I'll wait for you, so take your time.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.530
Thank you.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.370
We'll be right back as soon 
as we pray to the setting sun.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.530
We'll be right back!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:49.310
We finally reached the top.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.200
That must be the legendary pine tree.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.290
Let's go.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.680
It's the red armor.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.940
This side is the blue armor.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.390
It's powerful seeing it this close, isn't it?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.910
It really is.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.080
Did you hear that noise?

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.540
And a clinking sound before that?

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.060
Did you hear "Zakenna"?

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.950
I think so.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.690
Which means this is...?

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:31.020
Probably...

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.790
Just as we thought!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.360
Stay away!

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:12.350
Honoka! It's Dotsuku Zone's doing mipo.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:15.710
Nagisa! Hurry, and get off the island mepo!

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:19.280
You don't have to tell 
me. I already know that!

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.670
Of all times for this...

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.620
Nagisa!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.340
Where did that Nagisa go anyway?

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:40.040
It looks like Honoka is with her.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.210
Ryota?

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.840
Do you know where Nagisa and Honoka went?

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:44.700
No...

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.780
What's wrong, Ryota?

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.420
Actually...

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.850
I'm sorry I didn't say anything.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.260
She said they'd be back 
in time for dinner, and

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.560
they went to the island.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.350
The island?

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:05.030
Why did they go to the island?

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.900
If you go to the island, 
and pray to the setting

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:10.340
sun, your wish is supposed to be granted...

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.970
How could she...! When 
it's so close to dinner.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:18.140
It's going to get dark 
soon. Isn't it dangerous?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.610
I'll go and get them.

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.330
I'll go, too.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.130
Me, too.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.150
I'll go, too.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.780
Going alone is faster.

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.590
I know you're worried, but wait for us here.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:30.740
But...

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:37.030
I'll bring them back, so please wait here.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:39.670
Excuse me!

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:42.060
Is there a boat going to the island?

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:44.600
There's a fog today, so 
there aren't any boats.

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:49.930
I'm going to borrow that boat.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.280
Wait a minute!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.430
My oar...!

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:17.420
Wait for me, Nagisa... I'm coming.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.340
It's not going straight. I'm getting dizzy!

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.090
Now's our chance!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.260
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:05.420
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:08.290
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:12.160
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.560
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:19.000
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:52.800
White!

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.130
White...!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.590
Nagisa!

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.090
Dad...?

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:21.660
Nagisa! Honoka!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.410
Where are you? Answer me!

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:26.830
Don't get in the way!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.210
Dad!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.110
Let me go!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.350
Black!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.570
The sound of a flute...?

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:07.240
The feelings of sadness and conflict 
are still in that pine tree.

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.270
Is it the legend...?

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:18.850
Don't let go so suddenly.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.330
What in the world happened?

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:37.270
The young maiden's soul is sad.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.510
Black! Let's get Zakenna to remember.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:45.040
I won't forgive those who would 
defile a beautiful legend like that.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:49.480
Black Pulsar!

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:51.250
White Pulsar!

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:00.590
You, who have been taken prisoner 
by the spell of darkness...

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.280
Sever that chain now!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:08.060
Pretty Cure Rainbow Therapy!

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.800
Nagisa!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.300
Dad! Are you okay?

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:40.870
You idiot!

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:45.600
Why did you come out here without telling us?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.980
Do you know how worried we all were?

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.900
Don't do selfish things like that.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.070
Let's go!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.150
Dad...

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:02.540
We're sorry we made you all worry.

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:07.720
You mustn't be so reckless.

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:13.530
Nagisa... I heard your father scolded you.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.040
He did...

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.420
I've never seen him so angry.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:21.130
He really scared me.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:30.480
Nagisa... There's another version 
of the legend of Hibiki Island.

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:32.640
Another legend?

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:33.650
That's right.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:38.340
According to this legend, 
the young warriors with

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:42.960
the red armor and the blue armor weren't 
fighting over the young maiden.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:49.840
The young maiden was caught 
in the middle of a war,

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:52.370
and the two young warriors 
worked together to protect

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.910
the young maiden, and they 
both lost their lives.

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.300
Worked together, and fought?

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.930
That's right. To both of 
the young warriors, the

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:15.090
young maiden was the most 
precious thing in the world.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:19.060
The most precious thing in this world...?

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:31.700
It was a great bath, wasn't it?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.150
It really was.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.350
I'm going to the game corner.

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:46.960
Dad...?

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.160
What's wrong?

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:53.220
I'm really sorry about today.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.520
I'm glad you were safe,

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:02.470
but I was beside myself with worry 
that something had happened to you.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:09.050
After all, you're both the most 
precious things to me in the world.

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.760
Don't make me say it over and over again.

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:14.830
I could go for a beer right now.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:23.840
What's Great-Grandpa's portrait doing here?

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.130
This is Great-Great-Grandma!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:29.730
Great-Great-Grandma and 
Great-Great-Grandpa, too?

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.950
Why are you all so stiff?

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:36.940
The whole Misumi family is right before our 
eyes (misumisu), we can't miss (misu) them.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.350
I'm in great form.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:42.110
Please come again.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:50.720
Don't hang on so tight.

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:53.530
I can't carry our bags.

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:55.460
I'll carry them.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:58.260
It's okay. They're heavy.

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:01.480
What brought that on anyway?

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:04.240
I'll do it, too.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:07.010
Honoka-san! I'll carry your bag for you.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.480
No... It's okay.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.310
Let me do it.

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:18.470
What are my most precious 
children doing anyway?

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.690
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.670
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.950
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.890
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.930
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:42.970
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.370
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:45.970
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:56.910
Someone as perfect as Yuka wouldn't 
have any worries, would she?

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:59.600
But isn't it harder when 
people see you that way?

00:23:59.600 --> 00:24:01.640
I think everyone has problems.

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:02.910
Isn't that Yuka?

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:04.400
You're kidding... Isn't 
that her over there, too?

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:05.390
Over there, too.

00:24:05.390 --> 00:24:06.220
Over here, too.

00:24:06.220 --> 00:24:08.160
There are Yukas all over the place.

00:24:08.910 --> 00:24:12.800
"FULL THROTTLE STRESS! IT'S 
HARD BEING A SUPERSTAR"

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:15.750
Yuka's really like a "madonna," isn't she?

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:18.430
What do you mean (ma-donna)?

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:19.920
See you again next week.
